le":"Eco-sustainable, edible, biodegradable and antioxidant pectin and bacterial cellulose films loaded with coconut oil for strawberry preservation","type":"article","work_id":"W4409074635","year":2025},{"abstract":"","author_count":15,"author_ids":["A5014979148","A5025648479","A5034729579","A5058115615","A5059318009","A5062245120","A5063788411","A5067656771","A5072602554","A5076759824","A5079329779","A5080633438","A5084527213","A5117063879"],"author_institution_ids":["I157638225","I879563668"],"authors":[{"id":"A5058115615","name":"Camila Calderan Bebber"},{"id":"A5117063879","name":"Bruna Trombotto"},{"id":"A5080633438","name":"Guilherme Eccard Rezende da Cunha"},{"id":"A5059318009","name":"Rodolfo Debone Piazza"},{"id":"A5034729579","name":"Giovana Sant\u2019Ana Pegorin Brasil"},{"id":"A5079329779","name":"Josana Carla da Silva Sasaki"},{"id":"A5063788411","name":"Rog\u00e9rio Penna Gon\u00e7alves"},{"id":"A5076759824","name":"Lindomar Soares dos Santos"},{"id":"A5062245120","name":"Rodrigo Fernando Costa Marques"},{"id":"A5072602554","name":"Cassamo Usemane Mussagy"},{"id":"A5084527213","name":"Rosana Goldbeck"},{"id":"","name":"Wei Cao"},{"id":"A5025648479","name":"Ricardo Ant\u00f4nio Polanczyk"},{"id":"A5014979148","name":"Rondinelli Donizetti Herculano"},{"id":"A5067656771","name":"Betina Sayeg Burd"}],"ca_any_author":true,"ca_led":false,"cited_by_count":2,"doi":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2025.116519","domain_tags":[],"facet_tags":[],"institution_ids":["I130474213","I157638225","I181391015","I879563668"],"is_oa":false,"journal":"Journal of environmental chemical engineering","last_updated":"2026-10-26T11:51:55.731654","license":"","needs_review":false,"oa_status":"closed","oa_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2025.116519","openalex_topics":["T10661","T10753","T12336"],"plastic_related":false,"plastic_tier":"","primary_topic":"T10753","pub_date":"2025-04-07","study_type":"article","title":"Effect of supplemented diet on the kinetic profile of polystyrene biodegradation by Tenebrio molitor larvae: Physical, chemical, thermal, wettability and zeta potential measurements","type":"article","work_id":"W4409228587","year":2025},{"abstract":"","author_count":4,"author_ids":["A5012784195","A5012957048","A5014979148","A5072602554"],"author_institution_ids":["I157638225","I879563668"],"authors":[{"id":"A5012784195","name":"Yanjin Su"},{"id":"A5012957048","name":"Nayrim Brizuela Guerra"},{"id":"A5014979148","name":"Rondinelli Donizetti Herculano"},{"id":"A5072602554","name":"Cassamo Usemane Mussagy"}],"ca_any_author":true,"ca_led":false,"cited_by_count":8,"doi":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijbiomac.2025.146525","domain_tags":["occurrence_and_monitoring"],"facet_tags":["matrix:food_and_drink"],"institution_ids":["I130474213","I157638225","I879563668"],"is_oa":false,"journal":"International Journal of Biological Macromolecules","last_updated":"2026-11-10T11:39:43.021295","license":"","needs_review":false,"oa_status":"closed","oa_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijbiomac.2025.146525","openalex_topics":["T10480","T10488","T12048"],"plastic_related":false,"plastic_tier":"","primary_topic":"T10488","pub_date":"2025-08-02","study_type":"article","title":"Sketching deep eutectic solvents for the development of halochromic smart packaging using blueberry residue anthocyanins and alginate-based films for monitoring food freshness","type":"article","work_id":"W4412862295","year":2025},{"abstract":"Plastic biodegradation offers a sustainable complementary strategy for plastic waste management via biological depolymerization of synthetic polymers. Insects have demonstrated the ability to degrade various plastics through the synergistic action of their digestive system and intestinal microbiota. Additionally, numerous microbial strains have been identified with enzymatic capabilities to break down plastic polymers. Despite advances in this field, a major barrier to scientific progress is the lack of standardization in experimental methodologies. Variability in biodegradation agents, types of plastic, environmental conditions, and analytical approaches hinder the reproducibility, comparability, and practical application of results. Although several international standards exist for specific environments, their scope is limited and not universally applicable. This review highlights the urgent need for standardized, reproducible, and globally accepted protocols. It also emphasizes collaboration, methodological rigor, and technological innovation as central to the future of plastic biodegradation research. Clear and reliable biodegradability criteria are fundamental to scientific integrity, public trust, policymaking, and responsible innovation. The article concludes with recommendations to improve standardization across methodological, reporting, and collaborative dimensions. \u2022 Inconsistent definitions of biodegradation lead to systematic overestimation of degradation efficiency \u2022 Physical fragmentation and surface oxidation are frequently misinterpreted as mineralization \u2022 Polymer properties (e.g., crystallinity and Tg) critically influence enzymatic degradation rates \u2022 Inadequate reporting of pre-treatment and material characterization impairs data comparability \u2022 A multi-level framework is proposed to harmonize experimental design, validation metrics, and reporting practices","author_count":14,"author_ids":["A5012876343","A5012957048","A5014979148","A5025648479","A5031993549","A5034729579","A5059789817","A5067656771","A5076759824","A5077278637","A5080633438","A5084527213","A5086061321","A5117063879"],"author_institution_ids":["I157638225","I4210097936","I879563668"],"authors":[{"id":"A5067656771","name":"Betina Sayeg Burd"},{"id":"A5117063879","name":"Bruna Trombotto"},{"id":"A5080633438","name":"Guilherme Eccard Rezende da Cunha"},{"id":"A5031993549","name":"Juliana Ferreira Floriano"},{"id":"A5086061321","name":"Ma\u00edra Terra Garcia"},{"id":"A5034729579","name":"Giovana Sant\u2019Ana Pegorin Brasil"},{"id":"A5076759824","name":"Lindomar Soares dos Santos"},{"id":"A5012957048","name":"Nayrim Brizuela Guerra"},{"id":"A5025648479","name":"Ricardo Ant\u00f4nio Polanczyk"},{"id":"A5012876343","name":"Gabriela F\u00e9lix Persinoti"},{"id":"A5084527213","name":"Rosana Goldbeck"},{"id":"A5059789817","name":"Bryan J. Cassone"},{"id":"A5077278637","name":"Christophe M. R. LeMoine"},{"id":"A5014979148","name":"Rondinelli Donizetti Herculano"}],"ca_any_author":true,"ca_led":false,"cited_by_count":6,"doi":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2026.122471","domain_tags":["analytical_methods","fate_transport_and_sorption","wastewater_and_treatment"],"facet_tags":[],"institution_ids":["I146165071","I157638225","I17974374","I181391015","I4210097936","I4210152696","I48890080","I879563668"],"is_oa":true,"journal":"Journal of environmental chemical engineering","last_updated":"2026-11-10T11:39:43.021295","license":"cc-by","needs_review":false,"oa_status":"hybrid","oa_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2026.122471","openalex_topics":["T10324","T10661","T10753"],"plastic_related":true,"plastic_tier":"core","primary_topic":"T10753","pub_date":"2026-03-31","study_type":"article","title":"The challenges imposed by the lack of standardization in the advancement of plastic biodegradation research","type":"article","work_id":"W7144332703","year":2026}]}
